<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tito Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tito</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">Tito Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Tito Krstiyani imnetiyo maants b́ waa Ik' ash woterawwotsoke b́ wotor P'awlosi doo shishi keewon karndek't tep'oke b́ fini toohoni b́ teshi, P'awlos wosh han b́ guut' shweyon bíyere na'a wottso b́ fini tooho Titossh b́ wotor Tito manoor Ik' maa fino s'iilosh K'ert'esitsna b́ fa'o b́ teshi. B́ woshonwere bogon b́ s'iilir keez een een keewwotsatse.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iklo, Ik' maa jishirwotssh bítsnor K'ert'es ashuwots gond niwok'on bodetstsotse awuk'o niwon bonton beyo boon b́ geyitwok'o Titossh b́ gawiyiri, Gitlo, Ik' mootse fa'a k'osh k'osh jirwots man etonwere boshúweyi dúron een wotts nungushwotsnat maatswotsn, mank'o jawets núngushwotsnat guutswotsn awúk'o daniyo boosh b́ geyituwok'o Titosh b́ iziri, s'uwaatsnowere Krstiyani sheeng niwo bítsnor jenonat shunewon beyo, mank'o Ik' mootse shit'o, mooshonat k'alerawok'o wosho, Titosh izonat bín jisho b́ imiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik' maa jishirwots 1:5-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik' mootse k'osh k'osh jirwots fini bano 2:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Izonat ats kordek'on 3:1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 3:12-15</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1"/>Ik'i guutsonat Iyesus Krstos wosheets wottso P'awulosoke, Ik'o galbdek'ts ashuwotsi bo imnetiyon kup'shr, Ik'i ash beyo maants jishit aro bodanetwok'o wosheetso, <verse eid="TIT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2"/>Imnetiyanúwere Ik'o dúre dúri beyo imosh noosh b́jangitsatse need'ke, koorawo Izar Izewer kashan noosh imosh jam dúroniyere shin noosh taarre. <verse eid="TIT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3"/>Ari b́ gizewo b́ bodtsok'on noon worits Ik'o azaztsok'on taa t shishiyitwok'o taash imets adarok'on Ik'o bí aap'tso b́ jangi.<verse eid="TIT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2CO 8:23">2 K'or. 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gel. 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 T'im. 4:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Noshir wotts imnetiyon arikon t naayi wottsosh neesh Titosh, Ik'o nihoknat noon kashitso Krstos Iyesusokere s'aatonat jeenon neesh wotowe.<verse eid="TIT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Titos fino K'ert'esitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5"/>Neen K'ert'esitse k'aztk'rtso eegoshe manutseraawo manutsir, neen tiazaztsok'on Ik'i máá eenashwotsi kit kitotse nnaashitwok'owe. <verse eid="TIT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6"/>Ik'i máá eenasho eeg eeg bíatse deshawonat mááts iku kenihi wottsoni, shiraats jintsi wotonat bo alek'azeyatse tuutson k'ooreraw amants nana'úwotsi detsts asho woto bín geyife. <verse eid="TIT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7"/>Ik'i maa jishirwo Ik'i fino adaron b́ dek'tsotse bíyatse eeg eeg deshaw s'ayino woto bín geyife, mank'owore bika bako shiyawo, káári fayerawo, masherawo, fayetsi woterawo, gizosh k'awntrawo woto bín geyife. <verse eid="TIT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8"/>Maniyere ib dek'fo, sheeng keewo shuntso, káts wottso, kááwo, Ik'i finosh gaaletso, bítook kewdek'faltso wotowe. <verse eid="TIT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6-9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 3:2-7">1 T'im. 3:2-7</ref> </char></note> Arik wotts dano daniwon izosh k'efirwotsshowere aani dek'o b́falitwok'o danb́dek'ts amanets aap'ats kup'de'e.<verse eid="TIT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10"/>Ay ashuwots, bítsnor Ayhudi jirwotsi wottswots gofami niwo shoyirwots, alerawwots, datsmec'ron ooshirwotsnat dashirwots fa'ane. <verse eid="TIT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11"/>Ashaanotsi s'k boetetuwok'o wosho geyife, bo jitsit oot'o daatsosh woteraw keewo danifetst maa ash asho boshek'iri. <verse eid="TIT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12"/>Boyitse iko, botook nebiyiwo «K'ert'es ashuwots jam aawo kootetswotsi, gond s'ootswotsi, fin biitsts maac' geenzwotsiye» etre. <verse eid="TIT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13"/>Gawets gawanúwere arikee, mansh eshe shod deshaw imnetiyo bodetsetwok'o ashaanotsi ayide hadowe. <verse eid="TIT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14"/>Ayhudi tururi shuutso bo sha'irwok'o, ariko k'efiru ashuwots tzaziwotsno bok'ewawok'o kup'shde'e hadowe. <verse eid="TIT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15"/>S'ayn nib detstswotssh, jam keewo s'ayine, kiimwotsnat amaneraw ashuwotsshmó s'ayin wottso eegonwor aaliye, dabnwor bonibo wotowa bomaac'o kiimwtske. <verse eid="TIT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16"/>«Ik'o danfone» etirune, bofiinonmó jamere etetune bísha, bo wic'iknee, alerawwotsna sheeng keewo iko k'alo falawwotsiye.<verse eid="TIT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Arik wotts dani jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1"/>Neemó kááw danonton ik wotts dano daniwe, <verse eid="TIT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2"/>Eenash wotts nungshwots, bo detsts detsok'on beetwotsi, bo mango kotdek'tswotsi, bo atso kotdek'tswotsi, imnetiyonat shunon, k'amonowere jeenwotsi bowotitwok'o izwe. <verse eid="TIT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3"/>Mank'owere eenash wotts máátswots bo Ik' shatirwotsi bowotitwokowa bako oonetswotsnat, úsho shuntsowotsi bowoterawok'onat sheeng daniyo bodaniyituwok'o izuwe. <verse eid="TIT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4"/>Hank'owere guuy máátswots bo kenihotsnat bo nana'on bo shuneetwok'o, <verse eid="TIT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5"/>botook kewdek'tswotsnat s'ayinwotsn, mootse sheengon finirwotsi, bo kenihotsshowere keweyirwotsi bo wotitwok'o daniwne. Han bok'alitwere Ik' aap'o b́ k'eferawok'owe.<verse eid="TIT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6"/>Hank'owere jawetswots botoko korde'er bo beetwok'o izwe. <verse eid="TIT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7"/>Neewere sheeng wottso finefetsr jamkeewon boosh sheengon arewe, n danon kááw nwoto, ari keew kewetsi n woto kitswe, <verse eid="TIT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8"/>K'oorerawo jeeni noon keewo boosh kitswe, hank'on k'efirwots no ats bo keewit gond keewo bo t'ut'or jiitsitune.<verse eid="TIT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9"/>Guutswotswere bodoonzotssh bo kewetwok'o, jam keewonowere boon bogene'úshitwok'o, boosh bok'ayawok'o, <verse eid="TIT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10"/>bo gizonowere boatse boúmp'erawok'o izwe, maniyere dab noon kashit Ik' dano jam keewon b́ mangitwok'o jam aawo b́ jamon amanek nwoto kitsitne.<verse eid="TIT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11"/>Ik'o asho bín b́kashiyit b́s'aato jam ashosh kish kitsre, <verse eid="TIT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12"/>deeranuwere jamere etonat meets tewunon k'ayk'rar b́ tooko korde'er, kááwonat shayiri beewon datsanatse no beetwok'owe noon b́ daniyiri. <verse eid="TIT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13"/>Hank'on no jangirw deeretso, hank'owere noko eeno Izar Izewer, noon kashiyitwo Iyesus Krstos mangon b́ be'ewo kotirwone. <verse eid="TIT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 130:8">Dub. 130:8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kesh. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Iwi. 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 P'et'. 2:9</ref> </char></note> Krstos weeri god jamatse noon kashiyir sheeng fino finosh maawirwotsnat bísh gaalets s'ayin ashuwotsi nowotitwok'o noon s'ayintsosh no shegro b́ tooko beshidek't b́ími.<verse eid="TIT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15"/>Eshe keewanotsi daniwe, ali s'eenonowere izwe, fayono fayowe, konwor neen b́ gac'eraawok'owa.<verse eid="TIT 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Krstiyani nemó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1"/>Ash jametso kéwirwotsnat naashwotsnsh b́tooko dashan detson bo aletwok'o, sheeng keew jamo finosh k'andek'tswotsi bowotitwok'o, <verse eid="TIT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2"/>konatsor gond keewo bo keewrawok'o boosh gawiwe, dab maniyere ashonton fayerawwotsnat maac'nefwotsi, b́ jamon ash jamosh bo tooko dashan detso kitsitwotsi wotoone, <verse eid="TIT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3"/>Noowere haniyere shin danawwotsi, azazerawwotsi morrgondwotsi, noweeronowere sheelk'rts woterawwotsi, k'osh k'osh naari gusiyonat meetso geneúwoshosh kewetswots, weerigondonat nemi gondon beefwots, shit'eetswotsnat no atsatseyo fayefwotsiye noteshi. <verse eid="TIT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4"/>Ernmó no ato Ik'o doo wotonat ash shunon b́ be'ewor, <verse eid="TIT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5"/>noo nofints S'ayin finon b́ woterawo b́ took maac' k'ewon noon kashire, noon b́ kashiyiwere handr shweyon mashonat S'ayin shayiri weeron daatsets handrone. <verse eid="TIT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6"/>Ik'o noon kashitwo Iyesus Krstosn b́ shayiro ayidek't noosh kuut're. <verse eid="TIT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7"/>Hanowere b́k'al b́ s'aaton kááwar jangat nokotir dúre dúri kasho nonaatetwok'owe. <verse eid="TIT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8"/>Etetsanwere amaneke. Ik'on amants ashuwots sheeng finosh bokup'itwok'o keew jamahan kup'shde'er ngawiitwok'o geefe, keewanwere sheengonat ashosh ik ikon ot'etske. <verse eid="TIT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9"/>Ernmó dartswots mooshatse, naar taawotse, fayotse, nematse tuutson twit fayatse wokowe, keewanots eegor oot'deshawonat k'awntsalwotsiye. <verse eid="TIT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10"/>K'alewo dowet asho iknoto wee gitoto bín ni iziyakon bíyatse wokowe. <verse eid="TIT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11"/>Hank'o wotst asho k'uuronat morretske, bí b́ tookats angshtso b́wottsok'o dande'e.<verse eid="TIT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Wosh. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efe. 6:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">K'ol. 4:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 T'im. 4:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Art'emasi wee Tikik'osi itmaants twoshoor nee Nik'olyonits t maants wosh káárwe, taa joosho biyoke beshiyosh k'ut'dek're. <verse eid="TIT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13"/>Nem dantso Zenasnat Ap'losn bo sha'o de'er botwitwok'o woshwe, boosh geyit keew jamonowere boon tewu'e.<verse eid="TIT 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14"/>Noo ashuwotsuwere aani shwalo bo'orerawok'o err beyi kic'o ketiyo bofalitwok'o sheeng fino finosh dande'ene.<verse eid="TIT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15"/>Taanton fa'a jamwots jamó neesh t'intsirune, imnetiyon noonton kayitwotsi wotts no mashots bojamets jamo neesh t'intsirune.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Ik'oko s'aato it únetsnton wotowe.<verse eid="TIT 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3"/>
</usx>
